NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY CONTENT / 第三方内容说明

The MIT license above covers the node group "厚度&曲率烘焙", the material and
bake setup authored in curve.blend, and iterative_baker.py.

It does NOT cover the "xyzrgb_dragon" mesh embedded in curve.blend, which is
third-party material from the Stanford 3D Scanning Repository
(https://graphics.stanford.edu/data/3Dscanrep/). That model is provided for
research use and free redistribution WITH ATTRIBUTION to the Stanford Computer
Graphics Laboratory, and may NOT be used commercially. See README.md §11.

上述 MIT 许可仅覆盖节点组「厚度&曲率烘焙」、curve.blend 中作者自制的材质与
烘焙设置，以及 iterative_baker.py；不覆盖 curve.blend 内嵌的 xyzrgb_dragon
网格——该网格来自 Stanford 3D Scanning Repository，须署名 Stanford Computer
Graphics Laboratory，仅供研究与免费再分发，不得用于商业用途。详见 README §11。
